set.body:
Implement supplementary-variable projection as typed operator algebra.

A supplementary table must be bound to the exact fitted training-row space. Combine it with the fitted score operator, row form, and component geometry to produce a FunctionalFrame in the new feature space. Do not return an untyped loading matrix.

Acceptance:
- row identity, row count, centering policy, and component geometry are validated;
- Euclidean PCA agrees with multivarious project_vars fixtures;
- generalized row-measure behavior agrees with an independent dense oracle;
- consistent row permutations preserve the result;
- zero or numerically null components follow an explicit reject, drop, or regularize policy;
- provenance links the result to the supplementary table and fitted score operator;
- JVM and Scala.js pass.
